# Boot: pip install -r requirements.txt
# Antes do primeiro boot: python seed.py
# Depois: python app.py
# Porta: http://localhost:5000
# Projetos Flask no monorepo usam o mesmo padrão @baseUrl e separadores ###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Raiz da API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Listar tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Buscar task por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1

### Login (seed: joao@email.com / 1234)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### Estatísticas de tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Relatório resumo
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary

### Listar categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
